From: CosmosEx Buildroot <4372835+planeturban@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:52:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ce_main_app: system updates from the web interface

/api/v1/system/update: the state of the image's update tool
(/usr/sbin/ce-sysupdate), and actions: check for the newest published
image, install it, install an uploaded image (.img or .img.xz, the body of
the request), keep or leave a new system being tried, start the previous
one. The tool does the work (A/B root partitions, tryboot); the app only
starts it and reports.
